WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:00,799
Oh no!

2
00:00:01,199 --> 00:00:03,145
Maya's picture is not on her tablet.

3
00:00:03,845 --> 00:00:04,572
Where did it go?

4
00:00:05,272 --> 00:00:05,567
Look!

5
00:00:05,967 --> 00:00:08,450
It lives up in Cloud Town, with Sammy.

6
00:00:09,150 --> 00:00:11,478
Sammy is a chest that keeps things safe.

7
00:00:12,578 --> 00:00:13,595
That is S3.

8
00:00:13,995 --> 00:00:14,696
Storage.

9
00:00:15,396 --> 00:00:16,953
Theo wants to see the picture.

10
00:00:17,653 --> 00:00:19,296
But Sammy closes his lid.

11
00:00:19,996 --> 00:00:20,426
Hmm.

12
00:00:21,526 --> 00:00:23,587
Not just anyone can open the chest.

13
00:00:24,287 --> 00:00:25,814
So here comes a tiny key.

14
00:00:26,514 --> 00:00:29,022
One key, one friend, one chest.

15
00:00:30,122 --> 00:00:31,519
That key is a permission.

16
00:00:32,219 --> 00:00:33,113
That is IAM.

17
00:00:33,813 --> 00:00:34,957
Theo turns the key

18
00:00:35,457 --> 00:00:36,586
and the lid opens!

19
00:00:37,286 --> 00:00:42,356
Now you know: your picture lives in a chest in the cloud, and only the right key opens it.

20
00:00:43,056 --> 00:00:45,236
That is Amazon S3 and IAM.

21
00:00:45,936 --> 00:00:47,628
Check out the Cloud Town books.

22
00:00:48,328 --> 00:00:49,292
Link in the bio.

23
00:00:49,692 --> 00:00:50,664
See you next time!
